{"id":"entre","lemma":"entre","pos":"prep","rank":189,"glosses":["between","among, amongst, from","divided by"],"ipa":"/ˈentɾe/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-entre.wav","examples":[{"text":"Usted está entre amigos.","en":"You're with friends.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454424"},{"text":"Lee entre las líneas.","en":"Read between the lines.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38823"},{"text":"No comas entre comidas.","en":"Don't eat between meals.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460081"},{"text":"Elige entre estos dos.","en":"Choose between these two.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526966"},{"text":"Él es pobre entre pobres.","en":"He's as poor as can be.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704326"}]}